{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220480","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1322048001:1":{"text":"이고르, 또 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>한테 놀러 간 거야?","source_cn":"伊戈尔，你又去找<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1BD1D41F3E5507","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이고르, 또 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>한테 놀러 간 거야?","female":"이고르, 또 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>한테 놀러 간 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"154565","variant_female_record_index":"154566","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322048002:1":{"text":"맞아, 맞아, 아주 재미있게 놀았어! 근데 이번엔 새로운 사람이 있었어. 새로운 사람은 본 적 없어서 더 재미있었지!","source_cn":"没错没错，玩的可开心！但是这次有新人来，新的没见过，更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B59C66301F9C0AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322048003:1":{"text":"새로온 사람...? 아니, 이고르, 다쳤잖아. 이게 대체 어떻게 된 일이야?","source_cn":"新人……？不对，你受伤了。这是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09111DA6F2DD509F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1322048003":{"text":"새로온 사람...? 아니, 이고르, 다쳤잖아. 이게 대체 어떻게 된 일이야?","source_cn":"新人……？不对，你受伤了。这是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09111DA6F2DD509F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322048004:1":{"text":"세미라는 대단해. 그녀와 싸우는 건 재미있어!